      "rationale": "Snapshot mode of ADR 0011, built on planIndex. For each export with no unit, it blames the declaration's first line for the commit that introduced it, then takes the most specific evidence the repository keeps: a changeset naming the package, the commit body or subject, the TSDoc. Confidence is high only when that evidence names the unit or the commit introduced it alone. PR and issue text is linked, never quoted, and author names and emails are never stored. On this repository with an empty store it inferred 257 units: 27 high, 224 medium, 6 low.",
